    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]PROVOST MARSHAL'S FIELD OFFICE - NEW MASON COLONY, 61 CYGNI SYSTEM[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Deployment Priorities - LV-522 \"Chance's Claim\" AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-HM"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"Chance's Claim is a company-run power colony with a small civilian population and dual-reactor core."}

    {"The distress signal was followed by the deployment, and silence, of our Force Recon unit."}

    {"We must act quickly, but responsibly. Lives are likely still at risk; both ours and theirs."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a Forward Operating Base, ideally using existing infrastructure, without structural damage."}
    {"[bullet]Locate civilian survivors and FORECON personnel, avoid collateral trauma or panic."}
    {"[bullet]Ensure both nuclear reactors remain stable and under secure, humane oversight."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Avoid hostile escalation with Weston-Yamada operatives unless directly endangered."}
    {"[bullet]Preserve access routes for emergency evacuation through secondary tram tunnels."}
    {"[bullet]Disable enemy strongholds with targeted strikes and avoid unnecessary destruction of infrastructure."}

    {"You are not just marines, you're the last line of defence for people already abandoned once."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Colonel Adrian Blackburn[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]UNMC Provost Marshal | Hearts & Minds Movement - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]In service to justice and peace.[/italic][/color]"}

    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
