    {"[head=2][color=goldenrod]Operational Directive[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bold]To:[/bold] [italic]Commanding Officer, UNS Almayer[/italic]"}
    {"[bold]From:[/bold] [bold]TECHNICAL OPERATIONS DIRECTORATE - ANVIL STATION, HERCULINA ORBIT[/bold]"}
    {"[bold]Subject:[/bold] Research-Oriented Objectives - LV-522 \"Chance's Claim\" AO"}
    {"[bold]Reference:[/bold] 48-77-RI"}
    {"[bold]Classification:[/bold] [color=#cb0000][bold]CONFIDENTIAL[/bold][/color]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Commander,"}

    {"The Chance's Claim facility includes two Weston-Yamada reactors, a cryo-research sublevel, and multiple unreleased prototype systems for energy export."}

    {"Following the loss of a deployed Force Recon team, this site now qualifies for strategic data salvage."}

    {"Proceed carefully but thoroughly. Recovery takes priority."}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"[head=3][color=#8c0000]Primary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Establish a FOB that enables direct access to central reactor diagnostics and WY vault."}
    {"[bullet]Recover FORECON field data, biosample containers, and helmet cam logs."}
    {"[bullet]Secure and extract reactor core performance files and biosafety test modules."}

    {"[head=3][color=#134975]Secondary Objectives[/color][/head]"}

    {"[bullet]Use remotely operated scouts to document unusual behavior in geothermal maintenance tunnels."}
    {"[bullet]Preserve any modified reactor shielding or coolant tech for analysis."}
    {"[bullet]Survey enemy locations relative to electrical emissions or containment field failures."}

    {"[underline]This colony might not survive. The science must.[/underline]"}
    {"[color=#134975]‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾[/color]"}
    {"Signed,"}
    {"[color=#dfc189][bolditalic]Lt. Colonel Geoffrey Lamdem[/bolditalic][/color]"}
    {"[italic]Division Logistics Commander | Military Organization for Development and Innovation - 4th Combat Division[/italic]"}
    {"[color=#AAAAAA][italic]Onward through progress.[/italic][/color]"}

